very weird film. It's like a bizarre mix between a proto-slasher film, a violent 70's softcore roughie, a revenge flick, and whenever the cops appear on screen, it just jarringly shifts into a screwball comedy of errors before going back to the violence, sexual assault, nudity, murder, and gore with Krug's gang and those two poor girls.<br /> <br /> Then there's the music...<br /> <br /> Most of the time, the movie is set to vaguely folksy late 60's/early 70's hippie music and then the ending theme song &quot;Sadie &amp; Krug&quot; suddenly kicks in and it's some sort of weird mix of bluegrass, children's kazoo music, and a poor man's Creedence Clearwater Revival. <br /> <br /> Listen for yourself...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3gNErYr68bs\" data-code=\"3gNErYr68bs\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/3gNErYr68bs/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h6CLLA73mh0\" data-code=\"h6CLLA73mh0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/h6CLLA73mh0/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> The worst part is that I actually kinda like this movie unironically just because of how utterly fucked up and bizarre it all is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If e